                <pb facs="0402" n="368" sameAs="frus:frus1948v02/pg368"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On the evening of June 14 in London, Ambassador Douglas discussed with Strang, Massigli, and
                        Chauvel a new French proposal for a
                        <hi rendition="#italic">démarche</hi> to the Soviet Government regarding the
                    London Conference recommendations. The proposal was not accepted. For the report
                    on the discussion, see telegram 2639, June 16, from London, <ref target="#pg331"
                        >page 331</ref>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
